Lambda
A mathematica package designed for calculating λ-brackets
in both vertex algebras, and in SUSY vertex algebras. 
This is equivalent to calculating operator product 
expansions in two-dimensional conformal field theory.


Files in this directory:
* Lambda.m Lambda package source file
* Lambda.nb Notebook corresponding to Lambda.m
* basicfields.m Contains basic field definitions
* Example superconformal algebra.nb Contains examples of how to use Lambda
* COPYING Contains the GNU general public license
* README This file.

For further information, consult http://arXiv.org/abs/1004.5264 .